Small self-contained bugfix (+39/−4, two files): DFlash2 crashes during spec warmup while draft buffers are still unfilled. This moves the embedding outside the compiled region and clamps the selector gathers.

To save a reviewer the detour: the red `pre-run-check` is the repository's own pre-commit gate for contributors without prior merges — it isn't a failure of this change, and pre-commit never got to run.

@vadiklyutiy — you're on the review list here and own `gdn_attn.py` / `flashinfer.py`, so this is likely your neighbourhood; would you mind taking a look? Happy to rebase or split it further if that helps.

